{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9256b23d8de87e2543761c32118ca750f600a49f69c39b65bbf371c1a2d21ac1", "ja": "（紗代子達が出演する映画の撮影も、いよいよ佳境。\n今日は朝から、ビーチバレーのシーンだ）", "zh": "（纱代子她们在拍的电影终于到了故事的高潮部分。\n今天一早就要拍摄沙滩排球的镜头。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1001_p", "source_sha256": "87a55c1bacb1c245ceb97492edf3c1ffbb34f28b4aafe7727e813f0aa41809ad", "ja": "おはよう、紗代子。連日大変だろうけど、\n今日は特に大事なシーンだ。よろしく頼む！", "zh": "早啊，纱代子，接连几天真是辛苦你了。\n不过今天这幕格外重要，拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "ee2a8933f907c633e27a493809602835e318b21074daf5ad0ccf04bbffbffa8b", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}！\nはい、今日も1日よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "早安，{$P$}！\n好的，今天一天也请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "e18fa81d11dd9bc2134dae0785dbbbf34fe55a75a8f81e248999eb65561f9332", "ja": "実はさっきみんなと一緒に、浜辺をランニングして\nきたんです。ウォーミングアップはバッチリですよ！", "zh": "其实我刚刚才和大家在海边慢跑完，\n身体已经充分暖身过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "42cba904d4dbd490257ff28400e438f63486df9df01ac5861d6680b424845ef9", "ja": "さすが紗代子。気合いは十分みたいだな！", "zh": "不愧是纱代子，气势非常够呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "604daafc0acfa9eb4780ec74d92f73468dbb89ea07fe94ec5e62021ed7a9f7cf", "ja": "はい、まかせてください！　今日は私が演じている\n海美のお姉さん役の、1番の見せ場ですから。", "zh": "嗯，交给我吧！毕竟今天，是我演的\n海美的姊姊最有看头的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "2098ccb0e92017f9b989cdb09bc3b8082bb651fc46fe9fed39ef0a2815cc2fe4", "ja": "この日のために、台本もたくさん読み込んできました。\n力の限り、演じてみせます！", "zh": "为了这一天，我也熟读了剧本。\n我会尽力演出的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b4eb627a3d88f5050eabd4105bfd69870e7ba2cafafe23fa21f1d84c3f179556", "ja": "ああ、頑張れ。でも、ケガだけは気をつけてな！\nあまり無理をしないように……。", "zh": "好，加油，但你小心别受伤啰！\n千万不要太勉强自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "77a36bf2b1ca9f7c70585a7d0030c484777759d656a52cd60d55ab9ab3067256", "ja": "それなんですけど、{$P$}。\n今日だけは、無理をさせてもらえませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}，关于这件事……\n今天就好，可以让我勉强自己一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b2fc1a05b7fab05c5702eeb76d4c464828332ecb40d503754013a7ca1280aa38", "ja": "紗代子？", "zh": "纱代子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "cb7f93751590f9a008f6275d6b261a416f3e28f5896f424d6eaeb05d665e0554", "ja": "もちろん、ちゃんとこの後のことも考えて、\nできる限り注意します！　けど私、この役……。", "zh": "当然，我也有考虑到之后的事，\n我会尽可能小心的！但我演的这个角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "b0496b455223ef7439018e57a598f88d3c2f456233edfa79f9a0be7fb467f855", "ja": "傷ついた妹を待ち続ける姉役、どうしても……\n本気で、力の限り演じてみたいんです！", "zh": "痴痴等待受伤的妹妹回来的姊姊，我无论如何……\n都不想留下遗憾，想用全力去演好她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "daeae52c8c8f2c9b0161d7f4645c761d300ec6262f037eaf2ad7c91f752ad4a9", "ja": "紗代子……。", "zh": "纱代子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "ea4542ed595b72a28b262b04c7c1d297b4b49da921296d306d6260cb050e1c0a", "ja": "誰かのために、そしてそれと同じくらい自分のために、\n辛くても、ずっと立ち続けている強い気持ち……。", "zh": "为了某个人，同时也是为了自己，\n哪怕再痛苦，也要一直等待下去的坚定心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "18344fd2911846dc69feb80daac59c215354f80b2da187bf18c5ba4d848368ed", "ja": "この役を、完全にやりきることができたら。\n私も、大切な何かを、つかみ取れる気がするんです！", "zh": "如果能完美诠释这个角色，\n我觉得自己也能抓到什么重要的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "45511f12b03905fba7f5ccfa1d666fb485251c0478b6f8d139640d18b8a9d9ab", "ja": "だから……もしかしたら、少しだけ無理をするかも\nしれません。でも……どうか、止めないでくださいっ！", "zh": "所以……我也许会稍微勉强一下自己。\n不过……拜托你别阻止我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9c08297b82951e6ad3c901a45046c1b53c6d2ec2087ee484a812a62ec4233d5f", "ja": "なるほど……。\nよし、俺に任せてくれ。", "zh": "原来如此……\n好，包在我身上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5de24df2c3582db70ccd247bae3ee3c02c76bbc6068f79c0d494b1d1546cd977", "ja": "紗代子のことは、俺が十分注意して見ている。だから\n紗代子は役に集中して、思うようにやってみよう！", "zh": "我会特别留意纱代子的状况，所以纱代子，\n你就专心演戏，想怎么做就怎么做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "bd3c672cca05db5e1bb8bbf5c0396aba37836b38adc9a7522de7a1840621a3eb", "ja": "い……いいんですか？\n私、ワガママなことを言ってるのに……。", "zh": "真……真的可以吗？\n我明明提出了这么任性的要求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1020_p", "source_sha256": "71d533f2b70bc8e1cadb010bc9dc9d065ed138203512ddeb67f0926b5e18482c", "ja": "これで、大切なものがつかめそうな気がするんだろ？\nだったらやってみよう。俺は紗代子を信じるよ。", "zh": "你不是觉得这样可以抓到什么重要的东西吗？\n那就放手去试吧，我相信纱代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "11e40ce30f83258d159a8a3b6b7af61ac2d71eea8f60b2d4e7a2fe4ee619ccf4", "ja": "は……はい！\nお願いします、{$P$}！", "zh": "好……好的！\n麻烦你了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1022_p", "source_sha256": "5a1cd6a5bef5a367f58840b38e05af6e5702d36446f23381748ed243ea3993e4", "ja": "これ以上は本当に危険だと思ったら、止める。\nだからその時は、ちゃんと聞いてほしい。", "zh": "要是我判断继续下去会有危险，我就会阻止你。\n到时候希望你能乖乖听我说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "e368c22305976e089352ec5a43a388762945001db556f1da0d39683f3d1cad7f", "ja": "はい……わかりました。私も、\n{$P$}のこと、信じてますから！", "zh": "好……我明白了。\n因为我也相信{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0084_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "10bb911f5a4d59fa501e9aa92897f5c80a28e05978fa16aa56b3060254ff5c06", "ja": "じゃあ私、全部出しきってきます！\n{$P$}、見ていてください！", "zh": "那我要使出浑身解数了！\n{$P$}，请你看着我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
